title end
paragraph start
todo: copy and paste mechanism. The mechanism in editor/tui/text/clip.rkt (the ring of copies, paste per cursor, the OSC 52 clipboard, the notes in clip-notes.rkt) needs improvements. The owner decides what changes; related items are copy-cut-paste and the OSC 52 clipboard check. Give it its own test file.
paragraph end
section end

